  "subject": "理工学系_情报工学系",
  "text": "向量 $\\begin{bmatrix} X_1 \\\\ X_2 \\end{bmatrix}$ 服从二维正态分布，均值向量 $\\mu = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}$，协方差矩阵 $\\Sigma = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$。\n\n联合概率密度函数为：\n$$f_{X_1,X_2}(x_1,x_2) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi|\\Sigma|^{1/2}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}x_1\\\\x_2\\end{bmatrix}-\\mu\\right)^T\\Sigma^{-1}\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}x_1\\\\x_2\\end{bmatrix}-\\mu\\right)\\right)$$\n\n求以下问题：\n\na) $X_1 + X_2$ 的期望和方差\n\nb) $X_2$ 的边际概率密度函数 $f_{X_2}(x_2)$\n\nc) 条件 $X_2 = x_2$ 下，$X_1$ 的条件概率密度函数 $f_{X_1|X_2}(x_1|x_2)$",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "多元正态分布",
    "期望与方差",
    "边际分布",
    "条件分布",
    "协方差矩阵",
    "矩阵求逆"
  ],
  "question_type": "多元正态分布的性质",
  "method": [
    "线性组合的期望与方差",
    "积分法求边际分布",
    "条件正态分布性质"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "计算线性组合的均值和方差",
    "求协方差矩阵的行列式与逆",
    "推导边际和条件分布"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "multivariate_normal",
    "template": "$(X_1, X_2)^T \\sim N(\\mu, \\Sigma)$，求线性组合、边际分布、条件分布",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "a) $X_1 + X_2$ 的期望与方差",
      "steps": [
        "期望：$E[X_1 + X_2] = E[X_1] + E[X_2] = 0 + 0 = 0$",
        "方差：$\\text{Var}(X_1 + X_2) = \\text{Var}(X_1) + \\text{Var}(X_2) + 2\\text{Cov}(X_1, X_2)$",
        "从协方差矩阵 $\\Sigma = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$ 得：",
        "- $\\text{Var}(X_1) = 2$",
        "- $\\text{Var}(X_2) = 1$",
        "- $\\text{Cov}(X_1, X_2) = 1$",
        "因此：$\\text{Var}(X_1 + X_2) = 2 + 1 + 2 \\times 1 = 5$",
        "答案：$E[X_1 + X_2] = 0$，$\\text{Var}(X_1 + X_2) = 5$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "b) $X_2$ 的边际概率密度函数",
      "steps": [
        "边际分布 $X_2 \\sim N(0, 1)$（从协方差矩阵的对角元素得出）",
        "概率密度函数为：",
        "$$f_{X_2}(x_2) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi \\cdot 1}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{x_2^2}{2 \\times 1}\\right)$$",
        "$$f_{X_2}(x_2) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{x_2^2}{2}\\right)$$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "c) 条件概率密度函数 $f_{X_1|X_2}(x_1|x_2)$",
      "steps": [
        "对于二维正态分布，条件分布仍为正态分布。条件分布 $X_1 | X_2 = x_2 \\sim N(\\mu_{1|2}, \\sigma_{1|2}^2)$",
        "条件期望：$\\mu_{1|2} = E[X_1] + \\frac{\\text{Cov}(X_1,X_2)}{\\text{Var}(X_2)}(x_2 - E[X_2])$",
        "$= 0 + \\frac{1}{1}(x_2 - 0) = x_2$",
        "条件方差：$\\sigma_{1|2}^2 = \\text{Var}(X_1) - \\frac{[\\text{Cov}(X_1,X_2)]^2}{\\text{Var}(X_2)}$",
        "$= 2 - \\frac{1^2}{1} = 2 - 1 = 1$",
        "条件概率密度函数：",
        "$$f_{X_1|X_2}(x_1|x_2) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi \\times 1}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{(x_1 - x_2)^2}{2 \\times 1}\\right)$$",
        "$$f_{X_1|X_2}(x_1|x_2) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{(x_1 - x_2)^2}{2}\\right)$$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "设 $(Y_1, Y_2)^T \\sim N(0, \\Sigma)$，其中 $\\Sigma = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0.5 \\\\ 0.5 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$。求 $Y_1 - Y_2$ 的方差。",
      "knowledge_points": [
