    {
      "text": "设 $(W_1, W_2)^T \\sim N(0, \\Sigma)$，其中 $\\Sigma = \\begin{bmatrix} 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$。求 $W_1$ 与 $W_2$ 的联合概率密度函数。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "多元正态分布",
        "独立随机变量",
        "联合密度"
      ],
      "question_type": "联合概率密度",
      "method": [
        "正态分布密度公式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "因为协方差为0，两变量独立，密度函数为边际密度的乘积"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "joint_pdf_uncorrelated",
        "template": "协方差为零的二维正态分布密度",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "联合概率密度",
          "steps": [
            "因为 $\\text{Cov}(W_1, W_2) = 0$，两变量独立",
            "$f_{W_1,W_2}(w_1,w_2) = f_{W_1}(w_1) \\cdot f_{W_2}(w_2)$",
            "$= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi \\times 3}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{w_1^2}{6}\\right) \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi \\times 2}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{w_2^2}{4}\\right)$",
            "$= \\frac{1}{2\\pi\\sqrt{6}} \\exp\\left(-\\frac{w_1^2}{6} - \\frac{w_2^2}{4}\\right)$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "isct-2024-18d20a0bec-q04-practice-03",
