    },
    {
      "text": "设 $(U_1, U_2)^T$ 服从协方差矩阵为 $\\Sigma = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$ 的二维正态分布（均值为零）。求 $U_1 + U_2$ 和 $U_1 - U_2$ 的联合分布。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "多元正态分布",
        "线性变换",
        "联合分布"
      ],
      "question_type": "线性变换后的分布",
      "method": [
        "线性变换的协方差计算"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "计算新变量的协方差矩阵"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_transformation_normal",
        "template": "$Y = AX$，其中 $X \\sim N(\\mu, \\Sigma)$，则 $Y \\sim N(A\\mu, A\\Sigma A^T)$",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "联合分布",
          "steps": [
            "令 $Y_1 = U_1 + U_2$，$Y_2 = U_1 - U_2$",
            "$(Y_1, Y_2)^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} U_1 \\\\ U_2 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "计算新的协方差矩阵：$\\text{Cov}(Y) = A\\Sigma A^T$",
            "$A\\Sigma A^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "$= \\begin{bmatrix} 3 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$",
            "因此 $(Y_1, Y_2)^T \\sim N(0, \\begin{bmatrix} 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 \\end{bmatrix})$，$Y_1$ 与 $Y_2$ 独立"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "isct-2024-18d20a0bec-q04-practice-05",
